ext/static/chunks/0q20vnx90_mac.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0g8i_w-7ogbmh.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0rdwdmvtip0_d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/16j9e8lh44_ny.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Anjel - Builder</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Portfolio of Anjel Rana, a builder and developer, showcasing projects, skills, and experience in the tech industry.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0auj8n2.htj4w.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"geistpixelsquare_cf225766-module__N8E9Ma__className w-screen h-full antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template><div>Loading ...</div><!--/$--><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0-18k_7cyw51a.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><div class=\" scroll-smooth w-full relative flex flex-col flex-1 items-center justify-center dark:bg-zinc-50 bg-blue-200 select-none \"><div class=\"relative z-1\"><div class=\"data-bg-d h-screen w-screen fixed left-0 bottom-0 bg-zinc-50 text-black \"></div><div class=\"data-bg-l h-screen w-screen fixed left-0 bottom-0 bg-black text-white bg-effect  \"></div></div><div class=\"z-10 max-h-screen snap-y snap-proximity overflow-scroll no-scrollbar\"><div class=\"md:min-w-140 md:w-1/3 m-auto w-full px-6 flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"snap-start  h-screen flex flex-col items-start sm:pt-45 mt-20 dark:text-zinc-50 text-gray-900 z-10 \"><h1 class=\"text-2xl my-3\">Anjel</h1><div class=\"dark:text-zinc-300/70 text-zinc-800 mb-6\"><span class=\"text-xl\">25,</span><div class=\"relative inline\"><span class=\"text-xl ref={textRef} pl-2\"></span><span class=\"font-extrabold text-xl ml-[0.5ch]\">|</span></div></div><p class=\"my-3 leading-normal z-10  text-lg   text-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 \">Always wanted to be a footballer. Playing in the big leagues, chasing something bigger than myself. Unrealistic maybe, but that mindset never really left.</p><p class=\"my-3 leading-normal z-10  text-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 text-lg \">I’ve always had the urge to build things and create something of my own. Started<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.quikcrats.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 underline decoration-wavy decoration-amber-600 hover:text-amber-400 dark:text-zinc-300/70\">businesses</a> <!-- -->early (<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ijwifoods/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 underline decoration-wavy decoration-amber-600 hover:text-amber-400 dark:text-zinc-300/70\">brick</a> <!-- -->and mortar), learned graphic design, taught myself coding, explored systems, servers, design, and software — whatever sparked my curiosity. Mostly self-taught, experimenting, breaking things, and rebuilding them better.</p><p class=\"my-3 leading-normal z-10  text-lg   text-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 \">I’m an avid learner, but more than that, I’m obsessed with leverage through the internet.</p><p class=\"my-3 leading-normal z-10  text-lg   text-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 \">Distribution on the internet ummm ;&gt;</p><p class=\"my-3 leading-normal z-10  text-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 text-lg \">Long term, I want to build consumer hardware — products that feel futuristic but genuinely useful. But hardware needs serious R&amp;D, and R&amp;D needs capital. So for now, I’m deep in the software world,<!-- --> <a href=\"https://x.com/01_anra\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 underline decoration-wavy decoration-amber-600 hover:text-amber-400 dark:text-zinc-300/70\">building</a>, learning, and shipping toward that bigger vision.</p><div class=\"relative inline mt-2\"><span class=\"text-lg text-gray-800 dark:text-zinc-300/70\"></span></div></div><div class=\"flex space-between sm:gap-0 gap-2 sm:min-h-[80vh] md:my-20 my-10 snap-start scroll-mt-10 \"><div class=\"sm:w-32 min-w-16 \"><nav class=\"flex flex-col space-y-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300/70 font-medium\"><li class=\"underline decoration-wavy list-none cursor-pointer dark:text-zinc-300 font-medium\">2026</li><li class=\"hover:underline decoration-wavy list-none cursor-pointer text-gray-900/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 font-medium\">About</li><li class=\"hover:underline decoration-wavy list-none cursor-pointer text-gray-900/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 font-medium\">Blogs</li><li class=\"hover:underline decoration-wavy list-none cursor-pointer text-gray-900/70 dark:text-zinc-300/70 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 font-medium\">Pursuit</li></nav></div><div class=\"flex-1 grow \"><div class=\"dark:text-zinc-300/70 text-gray-900/70 scroll-mt-24\" id=\"year\"><div><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300/70 mb-6\">2026</div><p class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 my-4\">a log for keeping track of what I&#x27;m building, learning and doing this year.</p><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-900/50 dark:text-zinc-300/50 mb-4\">want to see other years?<!-- --> <div class=\"relative group inline-block hover:decoration-wavy hover:underline hover:font-bold hover:cursor-pointer\"><a href=\"/archive\" class=\" text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">check the archive</a></div></div></div><hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-300 dark:border-zinc-700\"/><div><div class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300/60 mb-2\">CURRENT FOCUS</div><p class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 my-4\">on finishing my web-dev &amp; web3 cohort, then starting building projects.</p></div><hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-300 dark:border-zinc-700\"/><div><div class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300/60 mb-2\">UPDATES</div><div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-900/50 dark:text-zinc-300/50\">feb 20</div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300\">Finished Android Repairing Course</div></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-900/50 dark:text-zinc-300/50\">may 15</div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300\">Built a10z.dev</div></div></div></div><hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-300 dark:border-zinc-700\"/><div><div class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300/60 mb-2\">MILESTONES</div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">finishing web-dev &amp; web 3 cohort</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">starting a saas and generating $1000 MRR</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">hspu &amp; muscle up</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">refractive surgery</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">going on a trek</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">generating ₹70k revenue per from brick &amp; mortar businesses</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 my-4\"><div class=\"min-w-5 min-h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-500 dark:border-zinc-300/70\"></div><div class=\"text-md text-gray-900 dark:text-zinc-300 \">Paying off the debt, took for business</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\" dark:text-zinc-300 text-black  py-6 snap-start \"><div class=\"font-medium text-2xl mb-4\">Projects I built</div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div><div class=\"flex gap-5 space-between dark:text-zinc-300 text-black rounded-lg  transition-colors p-2 dark:hover:bg-zinc-300/10 hover:bg-black/10\"><div class=\"w-1/3 my-2 \"><img alt=\"banner image\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-32 border w-full object-cover md:object-fill\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffigma.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ffigma.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffigma.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 pt-2 flex-1 \"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><div class=\"font-bold\">PWA e-commerce delivery app</div><div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center  \"><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:animate-wiggle\" href=\"https://www.figma.com/design/g9hU0sR02bwOyJsaFF3QRT/application-pwa?node-id=35-2&amp;t=ACZFfLMfCXynZiJy-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-move-up-right size-5 dark:text-zinc-300 text-black\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 5H19V11\"></path><path d=\"M19 5L5 19\"></path></svg> </a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:animate-wiggle\" href=\"https://github.com/ranaanjel/ecommerce-pwa\"> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-git2 lucide-folder-git-2 size-5 dark:text-zinc-300 text-black\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 19a5 5 0 0 1-5-5v8\"></path><path d=\"M9 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5\"></path><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> </a></div></div><div><p class=\"opacity-80 text-sm mb-2\">Had to take down, it was costing me $100 per month with few users, there is a figma link though<!-- -->.</p></div><div><div class=\"text-sm\">Technologies Used:</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-2\"><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">MongoDB</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">Figma</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">React</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">Nodejs</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">Websocket</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">Nextjs</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">Sqlite</div><div class=\"text-xs border py-1 px-2 border-black/30 dark:border-zinc-300/30 rounded-md\">AWS</div></div></div></div></div><hr class=\"my-4 border-gray-300 dark:border-zinc-700\"/></div><div><div class=\"flex gap-5 space-between dark:text-zinc-300 text-black rounded-lg  transition-colors p-2 dark:hover:bg-zinc-300/10 hover:bg-black/10\"><div class=\"w-1/3 my-2 \"><img alt=\"banner 